{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.poster.avif?t=1759110857\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.webm?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.mp4?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alpha Point is a next-generation, solo-indie masterpiece: a realistic, competitive multiplayer FPS packed with action, grit, and community...</strong><i>Whew,</i> that's a lot of adjectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.poster.avif?t=1759110857\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.webm?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.mp4?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Ray-Traced Graphics:</strong> Experience cutting-edge visuals with highly optimized ray tracing, delivering lifelike lighting and reflections on a solo-indie budget.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Movement &amp; Gunplay:</strong>\u00a0Master intuitive mechanics with responsive shooting, nostalgic movement, and tactical sprinting for never-ending, heart-pounding action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Rank &amp; Loadout System:</strong> Climb ranks through your wins, earn Tags to unlock weapons and characters, or risk it all to prestige for the rank boost you deserve. Go bankrupt and you'll be back at square one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Free-For-All:</i></strong> Eliminate every rival in sight. Bloodiest hands win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Team Deathmatch:</i></strong> Team up to outgun the enemy. Coordination is your edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Capture the Flag:</i></strong> Steal the enemy flag while defending your own. Strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Survival Games [<u>New!</u>]</i>: </strong>Collect gear and compete to be the last man standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With more on the way...</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Unique Maps:</strong> Battle across meticulously crafted arenas designed for intense firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eleven Distinct Weapons:</strong> From assault rifles to snipers to shotguns, customize the loadout that suits you best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Voice Chat:</strong> Strategize with teammates and taunt foes in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Anti-Cheat:</strong> Non-intrusive protection built into the code itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bartholomew...</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.poster.avif?t=1759110857\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.webm?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.mp4?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The times of war are upon us, and the Alpha Squad needs you. Feel the thrill of the high-stakes, innovative <strong>Rank &amp; Loadout</strong> system, where every match is a gamble on your future. <strong>Victory</strong> will progress your rank and earn you <strong>Tags, </strong>your currency for unlocking powerful weapons and unique characters. <strong>Defeat</strong>, on the other hand, will cost you Tags and set you back in the ranks. Play it <strong>safe</strong> to build your arsenal, or push aggressively for <strong>glory</strong>. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase enough weapons, and you'll gain the ability to <strong>Prestige</strong>, giving you the rank promotion you deserve, but at the cost of resetting your Loadout for a challenge anew. Run out of Tags entirely? You'll face <strong>Bankruptcy</strong>, wiping your Loadout clean and setting you back in the ranks. Alpha Point's <strong>Rank &amp; Loadout</strong> system rewards skill, strategy, and nerve, making every kill meaningful in your non-stop fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.poster.avif?t=1759110857\" width=1242 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.webm?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.mp4?t=1759110857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a passionate solo developer, Alpha Point is a living project shaped by community feedback, with additional planned content already coming your way. Join the fight, wishlist now, and head to the Alpha Point -- your squad is calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928680?t=1759110857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/ba62b8dadd4ccbe4957f25877b83c78e623c764b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759110857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/964bd11578c9122a4d0e9e9a69bb97ba109e8d0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759110857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/964bd11578c9122a4d0e9e9a69bb97ba109e8d0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759110857","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains blood, simulated character death (ragdolls), firearms, depictions of war, and general violence."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.poster.avif?t=1759110857\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co